<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>Stars Media — Football Content Agency</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Sora:wght@500;600;700&amp;family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,400;9..144,500&amp;display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{
  color-scheme:light;
  --white:#ffffff; --soft:#f4faf6; --ink:#0c1a12; --muted:#5b6b62;
  --green:#12b45a; --green-dark:#0a7a3d; --line:#dcebe2;
  --display:'Clash Display','Sora',system-ui,sans-serif;
  --serif:'Moneta','Fraunces',Georgia,serif;
  box-sizing:border-box;
  padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);
  padding-bottom:env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px);
}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth;scroll-padding-top:80px}
*,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:inherit}
body{margin:0;background:var(--white);color:var(--ink);font-family:var(--serif);font-size:18px;line-height:1.6}
h1,h2,h3,.display{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.02em;line-height:1.05;margin:0}
a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
.wrap{max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px}
header{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:20;background:rgba(255,255,255,.92);backdrop-filter:blur(10px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.nav{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;height:68px}
.logo{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-family:var(--display);font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.04em;font-size:18px}
.logo svg{width:36px;height:36px}
.logo span em{font-style:normal;color:var(--green)}
nav ul{display:flex;gap:26px;list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;font-family:var(--display);font-size:14px;font-weight:500}
nav a:hover{color:var(--green)}
.btn{display:inline-block;background:var(--green);color:#fff;font-family:var(--display);font-weight:600;font-size:15px;padding:14px 26px;border-radius:999px;transition:.2s}
.btn:hover{background:var(--green-dark);transform:translateY(-2px)}
.btn.ghost{background:transparent;color:var(--ink);border:1.5px solid var(--ink)}
.btn.ghost:hover{background:var(--ink);color:#fff}
.hero{position:relative;overflow:hidden;padding:96px 0 80px}
.hero::after{content:"";position:absolute;right:-140px;top:-120px;width:520px;height:520px;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(18,180,90,.18),transparent 68%)}
.tag{display:inline-block;font-family:var(--display);font-size:13px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--green-dark);background:var(--soft);border:1px solid var(--line);padding:7px 14px;border-radius:999px;margin-bottom:24px}
.hero h1{font-size:clamp(44px,8vw,92px);max-width:880px}
.hero h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--green)}
.hero p{max-width:560px;color:var(--muted);font-size:20px;margin:26px 0 34px}
.cta{display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.stats{background:var(--soft);border-block:1px solid var(--line)}
.stats .wrap{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:24px;padding-block:44px}
.stat b{display:block;font-family:var(--display);font-size:clamp(36px,6vw,64px);font-weight:600;color:var(--green);line-height:1}
.stat span{color:var(--muted);font-size:16px}
section{padding:96px 0}
.head{max-width:600px;margin-bottom:48px}
.head h2{font-size:clamp(34px,5vw,54px)}
.head p{color:var(--muted);margin:14px 0 0}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px}
.card{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:22px;padding:30px;background:#fff;transition:.25s;position:relative}
.card:hover{border-color:var(--green);transform:translateY(-4px);box-shadow:0 14px 34px rgba(18,180,90,.12)}
.num{font-family:var(--display);font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:var(--green);margin-bottom:34px;display:block}
.card h3{font-size:24px;margin-bottom:10px}
.card p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:16px}
.card.exclusive{background:var(--green);border-color:var(--green);color:#fff}
.card.exclusive p,.card.exclusive .num{color:#eafff2}
.badge{position:absolute;top:22px;right:22px;background:#fff;color:var(--green-dark);font-family:var(--display);font-size:11px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:999px}
.comps{background:var(--soft);border-block:1px solid var(--line)}
.chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px}
.chip{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;padding:12px 22px;font-family:var(--display);font-weight:500;font-size:16px}
.chip::before{content:"★";color:var(--green)}
.contact{text-align:center}
.contact h2{font-size:clamp(36px,6vw,68px);max-width:760px;margin:0 auto 14px}
.contact>.wrap>p{color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 44px}
.links{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px;max-width:900px;margin:0 auto}
.link{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:20px;padding:28px 20px;transition:.2s;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
.link:hover{border-color:var(--green);background:var(--soft)}
.link small{display:block;font-family:var(--display);font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--green-dark);margin-bottom:8px}
.link b{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:500;font-size:18px}
footer{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:30px 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:15px}
footer .wrap{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px}
@media(max-width:820px){
  nav ul{display:none}
  .grid,.links{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .stats .wrap{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:28px}
  section{padding:68px 0}.hero{padding:64px 0 56px}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <div class="wrap nav">
    <a href="#top" class="logo" aria-label="Stars Media">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" aria-hidden="true">
        <circle cx="24" cy="24" r="23" fill="#12b45a"/>
        <path d="M24 8l4.6 10.2 11.1 1.2-8.3 7.5 2.4 10.9L24 31.9 14.2 37.8l2.4-10.9-8.3-7.5 11.1-1.2z" fill="#fff"/>
      </svg>
      <span>STARS <em>MEDIA</em></span>
    </a>
    <nav>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="#services">Services</a></li>
        <li><a href="#reach">Reach</a></li>
        <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>
    <a href="#contact" class="btn">Get in touch</a>
  </div>
</header>

<main id="top">
  <div class="hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <span class="tag">Football media agency</span>
      <h1>We turn athletes into <em>stars</em>.</h1>
      <p>Strategic content, sharp storytelling and professional presentation for players, clubs and agents.</p>
      <div class="cta">
        <a href="#services" class="btn">Our services</a>
        <a href="#contact" class="btn ghost">Work with us</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="stats" id="reach">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="stat"><b>1 year</b><span>Of Stars Media</span></div>
      <div class="stat"><b>2,577</b><span>Followers</span></div>
      <div class="stat"><b>8</b><span>Competitions reached</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section id="services">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="head">
        <h2>Our services</h2>
        <p>Everything an athlete needs to be seen, understood and signed.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid">
        <article class="card"><span class="num">01</span><h3>Matchdays</h3><p>Matchday coverage and visuals that capture every performance as it happens.</p></article>
        <article class="card exclusive"><span class="badge">Exclusive</span><span class="num">02</span><h3>Athlete Carousel</h3><p>Our exclusive service: a carousel that tells the athlete’s story and highlights.</p></article>
        <article class="card"><span class="num">03</span><h3>Pre &amp; Post-Match Content</h3><p>Content before and after the game to keep the athlete’s profile active.</p></article>
        <article class="card"><span class="num">04</span><h3>Strategic Bio</h3><p>A bio written to position the athlete clearly for fans, clubs and agents.</p></article>
        <article class="card"><span class="num">05</span><h3>Content &amp; Profile Planning and Analysis</h3><p>Planning and performance analysis to grow the athlete’s profile with purpose.</p></article>
        <article class="card"><span class="num">06</span><h3>Presentation for Clubs and Agents</h3><p>A professional presentation that opens doors with decision-makers.</p></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="comps">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="head">
        <h2>Competitions reached</h2>
        <p>Eight competitions across Europe and beyond.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="chips">
        <span class="chip">Dakar 2026</span>
        <span class="chip">AF Lisboa</span>
        <span class="chip">AF Porto</span>
        <span class="chip">Azerbaijan Premier League</span>
        <span class="chip">Swiss Youth League</span>
        <span class="chip">Luxembourg Youth League</span>
        <span class="chip">Luxembourg Championship</span>
        <span class="chip">Conference League</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="contact" id="contact">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>Ready to shine?</h2>
      <p>Let’s build your story together.</p>
      <div class="links">
        <a class="link" href="mailto:starsmedia@icloud.com"><small>Email</small><b>starsmedia@icloud.com</b></a>
        <a class="link" href="https://instagram.com/starsmedia_" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><small>Instagram</small><b>@starsmedia_</b></a>
        <a class="link" href="https://wa.me/556281112025" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><small>Phone / WhatsApp</small><b>+55 62 81112025</b></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

<footer>
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="logo" style="font-size:15px">STARS <em style="font-style:normal;color:var(--green)">MEDIA</em></span>
    <span>© 2026 Stars Media. All rights reserved.</span>
  </div>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
